# SEC Filing NIM RAG & FinBERT Alpha Terminal

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.11+-blue.svg)](https://python.org)
[![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-1.41+-red.svg)](https://streamlit.io)
[![NVIDIA NIM](https://img.shields.io/badge/NVIDIA_NIM-Enabled-green.svg)](https://build.nvidia.com)
[![Tests](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tests-Passing-brightgreen.svg)](tests/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)

Production-grade **SEC 10-K Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** pipeline combining **NVIDIA NIM microservices** with **FinBERT quantitative sentiment analysis** and **realized equity volatility alignment**. Built for institutional equity research workflows.

---

## 🎯 Key Capabilities

| Capability | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| **Live SEC EDGAR Ingestion** | Automated 10-K fetching via `edgartools` (Item 1A Risk Factors + Item 7 MD&A) with deterministic offline fallback corpus |
| **Two-Stage NVIDIA NIM RAG** | `nv-embedqa-e5-v5` embedding → `llama-3.2-nv-rerankqa-1b-v2` cross-encoder reranking → `meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct` synthesis |
| **FinBERT Tone Quantification** | `ProsusAI/finbert` sentence-level sentiment → Management Optimism Index (MOI) [-1, +1] |
| **Volatility Alignment** | 7-day post-filing realized volatility & cumulative return via `yfinance` |
| **MLOps Observability** | Retrieval/generation latency, lexical groundedness scoring, citation verification |
| **Interactive Terminal** | Streamlit dashboard with Plotly visualizations for analyst workflows |

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[SEC EDGAR 10-K Filings] --> B[edgartools Ingestion]
    B --> C[Semantic Chunking<br/>RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter]
    C --> D[ChromaDB Vector Store<br/>nv-embedqa-e5-v5]
    D --> E[Stage 1: Vector Search<br/>Top-10 Cosine Similarity]
    E --> F[Stage 2: NVIDIA NIM<br/>Cross-Encoder Rerank<br/>llama-3.2-nv-rerankqa-1b-v2]
    F --> G[Top-4 Grounded Passages]
    C --> H[FinBERT Sentiment Scoring<br/>ProsusAI/finbert]
    H --> I[Management Optimism Index<br/>Bullish/Bearish Sentences]
    G --> J[Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct<br/>Cited Synthesis]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Streamlit Terminal<br/>Citations + Groundedness + Latency]
    B --> L[yFinance Market Data<br/>7-Day Volatility & Return]
    L --> K
```

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.11+
- [NVIDIA API Key](https://build.nvidia.com) (optional - runs in offline fallback mode without)

### Local Installation
```bash
git clone https://github.com/hrczggyrgy/sec-nim-rag-sentiment-alpha.git
cd sec-nim-rag-sentiment-alpha

python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env  # Add NVIDIA_API_KEY if available
streamlit run app/main.py
```

### Docker (Recommended)
```bash
docker build -t sec-nim-rag .
docker run -p 8501:8501 -e NVIDIA_API_KEY=$NVIDIA_API_KEY sec-nim-rag
```

