## 📁 Project Structure

```
sec-nim-rag-sentiment-alpha/
├── app/
│   └── main.py              # Streamlit interactive terminal
├── data/
│   └── .gitkeep             # Local cache for SEC filings & Chroma indices
├── notebooks/
│   └── eda_summary.py       # Cross-sectional EDA script (Jupytext-style)
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py          # Package metadata
│   ├── config.py            # Typed config, paths, model endpoints
│   ├── data_loader.py       # SEC EDGAR + Yahoo Finance ingestion
│   ├── features.py          # Semantic chunking + FinBERT scoring
│   ├── model.py             # NVIDIA NIM Two-Stage RAG engine
│   └── utils.py             # Logging, groundedness, Plotly charts
├── tests/
│   └── test_pipeline.py     # Pytest suite (ingestion, FinBERT, RAG)
├── .gitignore
├── requirements.txt
├── Dockerfile
└── README.md
```

