## 🧪 Testing

```bash
# Run full test suite
pytest tests/ -v

# With coverage
pytest tests/ --cov=src --cov-report=term-missing
```

**Test Coverage:**
- ✅ SEC Data Loader (live EDGAR + synthetic fallback)
- ✅ FinBERT Feature Pipeline (chunking + sentiment ratios)
- ✅ NVIDIA NIM RAG Engine (indexing, retrieval, reranking, synthesis)
- ✅ Groundedness Metric (lexical overlap validation)

