## 🔧 Configuration

Environment variables (`.env`):

```bash
# Required for live NVIDIA NIM endpoints
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional: Custom SEC EDGAR user agent
SEC_USER_AGENT="MyResearchBot contact@myemail.com"
```

Model hyperparameters in `src/config.py`:
```python
@dataclass(frozen=True)
class ModelConfig:
    nim_llm_model: str = "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct"
    nim_embed_model: str = "nvidia/nv-embedqa-e5-v5"
    nim_rerank_model: str = "nvidia/llama-3.2-nv-rerankqa-1b-v2"
    finbert_model: str = "ProsusAI/finbert"
    chunk_size: int = 1200
    chunk_overlap: int = 180
    top_k_initial: int = 10
    top_k_rerank: int = 4
    llm_temperature: float = 0.1
    llm_max_tokens: int = 1024
```

