## 🧬 Offline Fallback Mode

Runs **100% offline** without `NVIDIA_API_KEY`:
- Deterministic hash embeddings replace `nv-embedqa-e5-v5`
- Lexical overlap reranking replaces `NVIDIARerank`
- Extractive synthesis replaces `Llama-3.3-70B`
- Loughran-McDonald lexicon replaces `FinBERT`

Perfect for CI/CD, recruiter evaluation, and air-gapped environments.

